# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — VIDYASETU

## 1. Project Overview

Build a complete, modern, responsive, production-oriented web application named **VidyaSetu**.

**Project title:** VidyaSetu — Multilingual Digital Learning Platform for Rural Government Schools

**Tagline:** “Bridging Villages Through Learning.”

**Core mission:** Design and develop an accessible digital learning platform that provides interactive, activity-based educational content in multiple Indian regional languages for students in Classes 1–8 studying in rural and small-village government schools.

The platform must work on low-cost smartphones, tablets, laptops, and shared classroom computers. It must support offline learning because many rural schools have unreliable internet connectivity.

IMPORTANT: Do not create only a static landing page, a design mockup, or a frontend with nonfunctional buttons. Build a complete full-stack application with a working frontend, secure backend, supervised content management, database, authentication, real learning interactions, and offline capabilities.

Develop the application directly inside the current project workspace. Create all required files, implement the features, configure the architecture, run the application, and test the core workflows.

